# PLAN-924 native closures-resource scenario suite — the R02 (closure
# domain) and R05 ac cells of the M1 grid, closed by REAL source rides
# through the native closures pipeline (shared closures MIR → native
# admit/CLIF/COFF → the same no_std runtime/4 with the closure env
# surface → PE), with the per-seam injection knobs (S1/S4/S9) baked into
# the entry wrapper. The parent freezes the exit values, the trap/seam
# facts and the R05 env-lifecycle event shape in its own table (never the
# worker's word); the base runs freeze the creator-exit indirect-call
# results. The full R02 aggregate additionally requires the 923
# non-closure domain (L04/L05/V05/LSTR/typed clone) re-verified under this
# final runtime — that is the 923 suite's own group on this tree, plus
# this suite for the closure domain.

```test-suite
suite { schema: "autolang.suite/2", id: "ace-m1-native-closures-924", include: [
  "native-closures-924.case.ad",
] }
